      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.72,
      "end_seconds": 265.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like diabetic ketoacidosis, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.04,
      "end_seconds": 300.38,
      "duration_seconds": 16.34,
      "text": "we should do a blood sugar and ketone test for thirst and vomiting i'm going to order blood gas and electrolytes, for DKA you need to go to hospital now for insulin and fluids have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
